[{"id":2487461166,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6UQ6Uu","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. This is a great start 🙂 \r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- I suggest renaming the Measure tool to Ruler (also with its internal enum name), so that it matches the name in the 2D editor. This should also be done for the shortcut name.\r\n- Draw the distance text with a black outline, and use the bold editor font with a *slightly* increased font size. Doing this will help a lot with visibility on mixed-color backgrounds, which can be an issue right now:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a484b511-1136-436c-a5d1-3025bd00d669)\r\n\r\nSee the 2D editor for reference:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c17b5dd5-d9ae-4136-af6e-be68ccb36bfa)\r\n\r\n- Display a the unique with a `m` suffix for \"meters\" (e.g. `123.456 m`), as 3D units are meters in Godot.\r\n- Round the display to 3 decimals using `String.pad_decimals()`, so there's always 3 decimals displayed (even if technically not needed in some cases). This prevents the text from jumping around as the ruler moves.\r\n- The ruler line occasionally disappears depending on which direction it's going towards:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f3bf184-5eb8-4a48-bfe2-3c83301d2805\r\n\r\nThis issue depends on the camera angle. It never occurs if the camera is looking straight down by pressing <kbd>KP 7</kbd>.\r\n\r\n- You could look into replicating the rectangle and angle measurements from the 2D ruler in the 3D ruler, but this can be left for a future PR.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100162#pullrequestreview-2487461166","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100162","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100162#pullrequestreview-2487461166"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100162"}},"submitted_at":"2024-12-09T01:57:18Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2492673036,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6UkywM","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_vi